# Mairam's Restaurant Website

This project is a simple website built for my Web Lab Task.  
It includes:
- Homepage (index.html)
- Feedback Form (feedback.html)
- About Page (about.html)
- Styling (style.css)

## Purpose
To practice HTML forms, navigation, and basic CSS styling.

## How to View
Open `index.html` in a browser or visit the GitHub Pages link once published.
